@startuml
skinparam conditionStyle diamond
skinparam ConditionEndStyle diamond
skinparam ActivityDiamondFontSize 11

|Acquisition Employee|
start
:Select prospective pharmacy;
:Call pharmacy to arrange a visit;
if (Appointment agreed?) then ([yes])
  :Visit pharmacy on agreed date;
  :Introduce Timaflu and explain\npersonal service;
  :Present product catalogue\nand discount conditions;
  :Hand over information folder;
  |Acquisition Employee|
  :Enter company, contact person,\ncontact details, address and visit date;
  |System|
  :Validate prospective customer\nand acquisition visit data;
  if (Data valid?) then ([yes])
    :Save prospective customer\nand acquisition visit;
    :Make visit available in follow-up\noverview after one month;
    :Show confirmation;
    stop
  else ([no])
    :Show error message;
    stop
  endif
else ([no])
  |Acquisition Employee|
  :Do not register a visit;
  stop
endif
@enduml
